docs {
  # POST /api/v1/jasamarga-ops/briefing

  The "Executive Briefing" (shift report) for the JasaMarga lead, synthesized
  deterministically from the snapshot — sections: Ringkasan Operasi, Insiden
  (Laporan Publik), Titik Macet Teratas, Sentimen Publik, Pengumuman Resmi,
  Liputan Media, Proyeksi, Rekomendasi. **Public**, no LLM in the demo.

  **Source:** `apps/web/app/api/v1/jasamarga-ops/briefing/route.ts`

  ## Response (200)
  ```json
  {
    "content": "## Ringkasan Operasi\nIndeks kemacetan **0.9/10 (Lancar)** ...\n## Insiden (Laporan Publik)\n- ...\n## Rekomendasi\n1. ...\n\n_Sumber data: Traffic Flow (TomTom) · Insiden Lalu Lintas (TomTom)._",
    "updated_at": "29 Mei, 11.12"
  }
  ```
  Same Markdown contract the shared `BriefingPanel` renders.
}
